# D6 — Lobby creation burst
# Logic: At least ten lobby creations from one source IP in a 1-minute bin.
# Threshold: 10 creates / 1m / src_ip (lab-tuned, per src_ip)
# Confidence: Medium
# ATT&CK: T1499.003 (conditional)   CWE: CWE-770
# Validated: 2026-10-14 — positive fired (15 creates), negative silent, isolated case windows
index=c09 event=lobby_create
| bin _time span=1m
| stats count by _time, src_ip
| where count >= 10
